<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-089-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.425394" lon="-120.936572"><name>SC26-089-B</name><cmt>SC26-089</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.2 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 56/100; not catch probability. Center 71 ft; nearby 69–86 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-068</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.42859378706533" lon="-120.93654498292733"/><trkpt lat="35.42834979722622" lon="-120.93809317775445"/><trkpt lat="35.427737831502185" lon="-120.9392101799589"/><trkpt lat="35.42764208284879" lon="-120.93888220092731"/><trkpt lat="35.427371754265" lon="-120.93888909104444"/><trkpt lat="35.42737739331876" lon="-120.93921936533256"/><trkpt lat="35.42710706466567" lon="-120.93922625425576"/><trkpt lat="35.427110823496136" lon="-120.93944643643071"/><trkpt lat="35.426033266881674" lon="-120.939694167544"/><trkpt lat="35.42583801225968" lon="-120.93881804398134"/><trkpt lat="35.42547569419695" lon="-120.93871714163095"/><trkpt lat="35.42537994450022" lon="-120.93838917229404"/><trkpt lat="35.42510961589899" lon="-120.93839606348341"/><trkpt lat="35.424647785497584" lon="-120.93774702264182"/><trkpt lat="35.42437745697290